# Per-cell raw JSON/log output from every runner in this package -- large,
# regenerable, and machine-specific (the whole point of run_parity_gate.py is
# that these are NOT portable across boxes without a parity verdict). The
# summary/verdict artifacts each runner distills them into ARE committed
# (see the negations below) -- those are the human/agent-facing evidence.
results_*/
*.log

# Summary / verdict artifacts stay committed -- do NOT ignore these.
!PARITY_VERDICT.json
!PARITY_VERDICT.md
!ECERT_SUMMARY.json
!ECERT_SUMMARY.md
!NOISE_FLOOR_TABLE.json
!NOISE_FLOOR_TABLE.md
!RUNTIME_TABLE.json
!RUNTIME_TABLE.md
!PESSIMISM_N1000_SUMMARY.json
!PESSIMISM_N1000_SUMMARY.md
!DEEP_N1000_SUMMARY.json
!DEEP_N1000_SUMMARY.md
!TAIL_N1000_SUMMARY.json
!TAIL_N1000_SUMMARY.md
